mputed from two filed figures).","cites":["AAPL.buybacks.2026","AAPL.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-26 revenue was $114 billion (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), up 11.7% from $102 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-27.","cites":["AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2024-09-29.2025-09-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2024-09-29.2025-06-28"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-26 revenue added up to $479 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $158 billion and net income to $132 billion.","cites":["AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-12-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.revenue.2026-03-29.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-12-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.opinc.2026-03-29.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-12-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.netinc.2026-03-29.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-09-28.2026-06-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $136 billion: operating cash flow of $145 billion less capital spending of $9 billion (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2026-09-26"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-01-08 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $74.3 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $108 million.","cites":["AAPL.pay.peoTotal.2025","AAPL.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $23.8 million in total and $34.1 million actually paid.","cites":["AAPL.pay.neoTotal.2025","AAPL.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $233.88 at the end of FY2025, and $279.51 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["AAPL.pay.tsr.2025","AAPL.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $14.8 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $13.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["AAPL.deferred.2026","AAPL.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 167,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $2.9 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["AAPL.q.employees","AAPL.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $36.3 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $20.4 billion in short-term investments, and $80.1 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent + CommercialPaper). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $23.4 billion (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["AAPL.cash.2026","AAPL.sti.2026","AAPL.debtLong.2026","AAPL.debtCurrent.2026","AAPL.debtShort.2026"]}]},"fin":{"AAPL":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":55,"read":55,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Newstead Jennifer","SVP, GC and Government Affairs"],["LEVINSON ARTHUR D","Director"],["Parekh Kevan","Senior Vice President, CFO"],["Borders Ben","Principal Accounting Officer"],["Ternus John","CEO, director"],["O'BRIEN DEIRDRE","Senior Vice President"],["COOK TIMOTHY D","Executive Chair, director"],["Newstead Jennifer","